		"title": "n8n Node Contract: the trigger interface",
		"version": "2.10.0",
		"description": "Generated from spec/wit (world trigger-bundle) by scripts/spec.ts. Do not edit.\n\nA trigger: it starts executions. The host calls `poll` for a `poll` trigger, and `activate`,\n`check`, `webhook` and `deactivate` for a `webhook` trigger.\n\nBoth sides send requests on one connection. `x-direction` tells which side answers a method. A method without `result` is a notification. Names in brackets are not WIT functions: the JSON-RPC mapping adds them."
	},
